# Build context for deploy/docker/base.Dockerfile (ADR 0072). It COPYs pyproject.toml, uv.lock,
# .python-version, packages/, edge/, core/, simulator/, eval/ and tools/; everything else, and
# anything below that is a cache, a test, a secret or generated data, stays out of the image.
.git
.github
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.hypothesis
**/tests
sim-out
eval/reports
legacy
docs
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/dist-e2e
deploy/compose/secrets
deploy/compose/proxy-tls
*.carto
*.db
.env*
coverage.xml
.coverage
requirements-export.txt
sbom*.json
